        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack White, Brian Muldoon\n- Bands: The White Stripes, The Upholsterers, The Muldoons\n- Products: Live at Third Man, Blunderbuss\n- Companies: Third Man Records\n\nFacts:\n- The Upholsterers was a two-piece band composed of Jack White and Brian Muldoon of The Muldoons.\n- Jack White produced Live at Third Man as a member of The White Stripes.\n- Live at Third Man was released as a 12-inch vinyl record on Third Man Records.\n- On April 24, 2012, Jack White released his debut solo album, Blunderbuss.",
